2. Arrowshot (arrow proportions)
============================================================================

The tapered arrow outline in src/ainotate/geometry.py uses the proportions of
Skitch-style arrows as measured and published by Arrowshot
(https://github.com/TaroMoteki/Arrowshot): a flat-based head about 0.98 as
wide as it is long, and an exponential taper of the shaft from 0.44 at the
neck to 0.075 at the tail, relative to the head half-width. No Arrowshot code
is included; the notice below is reproduced as its license requires for
derived work.

