3. github/awesome-copilot, skills/image-annotations (label placement idea)
============================================================================

The label-placement idea used in src/ainotate/render.py (placing callout
labels next to their targets, away from the content they describe) is
adapted from the image-annotations skill in
https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot (skills/image-annotations). The
implementation in AInotate is its own.

